Consider number x, which appears at time x:
[x, 2x-1] remains at position x
t = [2x, 3x-1], x-(t-2x+1) = 3x-t-1;
t = [3x], x goes to 3x/2

t = 2x, x
t = 3x, 3x/2
t = 3x+3x/2, (3x+3x/2)/2 = 9x/4;
the position multiplies by 3x/2 each time

